    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULLETnico is a classic shoot 'em up with charming characters and a short story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow COMMANDER BULLET on his quest to explore an unregistered Planet. Stand in the face of dangerous Beast that await to be slain. It is your Mission to keep the UNIVERSE SAFE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have  what it takes to be a BULLET HERO?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and prove it in 4 Levels, 5 Bosses and 2 different Endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530540/extras/987e4d6474b7c1cb94fd35439cd5b832.poster.avif?t=1747096693\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530540/extras/987e4d6474b7c1cb94fd35439cd5b832.webm?t=1747096693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530540/extras/987e4d6474b7c1cb94fd35439cd5b832.mp4?t=1747096693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
